<!-- ============================ ARTICLES INDEX ============================ -->
<section class="journal-grid-page">
  <div class="container">
    <p style="margin-bottom: 40px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;"><a href="../index.html#top" style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600;">← Back to Beets &amp; Co</a></p>
    <div class="grid-layout">
      
      <!-- Post: Instagram Grid Maker (free tool) -->
      <a href="instagram-grid-maker-free.html" class="post-card">
        <div class="card-top t2"><span class="gl">▦</span></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="cat">Free Tool · 5 min</div>
          <h3>Free Instagram grid maker — design your feed</h3>
          <p>Split photos across a grid, build a puzzle feed, or lay out branded tiles with text. Free, no signup, no watermark — plus how to actually use a grid to grow a business.</p>
          <span class="rd">Read article <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Post: Content Marketing for Local SEO -->
      <a href="content-marketing-for-local-seo.html" class="post-card">
        <div class="card-top t1"><span class="gl">▶</span></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="cat">Content &amp; SEO · 6 min</div>
          <h3>Content marketing for local SEO — why real beats AI</h3>
          <p>Most businesses publish content that sits there doing nothing. Here's what a connected content ecosystem actually looks like — with a real case study.</p>
          <span class="rd">Read article <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Post 1 -->
      <a href="branding-bayside-trade-businesses.html" class="post-card">
        <div class="card-top t1"><span class="gl">Aa</span></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="cat">Branding · 6 min</div>
          <h3>More than a logo: what your business actually needs</h3>
          <p>Most local businesses have a logo. Few have a brand. The practical difference — and why the gap is costing you jobs.</p>
          <span class="rd">Read article <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Post 2 -->
      <a href="web-design-bayside-melbourne-tradies.html" class="post-card">
        <div class="card-top t2"><span class="gl">&lt;/&gt;</span></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="cat">Web Design · 5 min</div>
          <h3>Why most local websites lose the job before the call</h3>
          <p>What a Bayside business website needs to win trust in the first seven seconds — and rank in your suburb.</p>
          <span class="rd">Read article <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Post 3 -->
      <a href="local-seo-melbourne-trade-businesses.html" class="post-card">
        <div class="card-top t3"><span class="gl">◎</span></div>
        <div class="card-body">
          <div class="cat">SEO · 7 min</div>
          <h3>Local SEO that actually works in Melbourne</h3>
          <p>Google Business Profile, reviews, on-page signals and suburb content — what moves the needle and what doesn't.</p>
          <span class="rd">Read article <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
        </div>
      </a>

            <!-- Post 5: Digital Marketing -->
            <a href="digital-marketing-agency-frankston.html" class="post-card">
                <div class="card-top t2"><span class="gl">◎</span></div>
